Lifecycle: Configure -> Idle (bodies at marks, twins' keeper body hidden, ball on the spot; the coin toss runs here) -> Begin -> Intro -> Placing -> WhistleRaise -> Armed -> Live -> Verdict -> Scored|WalkBack -> [replay] -> Placing ... -> Decided -> [replay] -> Over (cursor freed). Choreo hooks and when they fire: OnPlacing(driver) after every placement; OnAiTakerToSpot(driver, body, onArrived) right after OnPlacing when an AI takes and Choreo != null (the body starts at its LineupMark; the driver snaps it to RunUpStart on arrival or after 8 s); OnScored(driver, scorer) at Scored entry (scorer already Freed); OnWalkBack(driver, shooter, onArrived) at WalkBack entry (without Choreo the phase lasts 1.4 s); OnRoundDecided(driver, winner) then OnWinBeat(driver, winner) then OnLoseBeat(driver, body) per Active non-parked losing body, all at Decided entry. Windows: ScoredWindowOpen 5 s (CanLocalSkip = local is LastScorerSlot); WinBeatOpen 5 s when a human is on the winning side else the 4 s dejection (CanLocalSkip = local is the scorer, or the human keeper of the decisive save on the winning side).

